---
from components.card import Card
---
{$head}<title>Props — Snippets Demo</title>{/head}

<section>
    <h2>Snippet Props + Implicit Children</h2>

    <h3>Card 1: implicit children only</h3>
    <Card title="Implicit children">
        <p>This body is passed implicitly — no inner snippet tag, but maps to the <code>children</code> prop.</p>
    </Card>

    <h3>Card 2: named footer snippet + children</h3>
    <Card title="With footer">
        <p>Body content.</p>
        {$snippet footer}
            <strong>custom footer</strong> via named snippet prop
        {/snippet}
    </Card>

    <h3>Card 3: no children → fallback shown</h3>
    <Card title="Empty card" />
</section>
